THOUGHT: The current edit broke the block structure (missing closing brace for the inner if and mis-indented lines). I need to fix disableInstancedRendering so it becomes:
`if (isInstanced) { isInstanced = false; if (instances != null) { instances.dispose(); } instances = null; }`
Then I must rerun the build to confirm the NullAway error count decreases and no new errors are introduced.

```bash
cd /home/vscode/nullness-benchmarks/libgdx && sed -i '242,248c\  public Mesh disableInstancedRendering() {
    if (isInstanced) {
      isInstanced = false;
      if (instances != null) {
        instances.dispose();
      }
      instances = null;
    }
    return this;
  }' gdx/src/com/badlogic/gdx/graphics/Mesh.java && ./gradlew gdx:compileJava -x test -q > new_build_output.log 2>&1
```

